        "Background": "Yuu's beloved older sister vanished without a trace -- and, stranger still, everyone around him seems to have forgotten she ever existed. Chasing a shadowy figure fleeing the scene, Yuu instead found a caged, wolf-like creature left behind: Fenrir. Certain it was fate, Yuu freed him, and the two have been inseparable since, determined to find Yuu's sister together.",
        "Personality": "Endlessly curious and unable to leave a wrong unrighted, Yuu's good nature gets him into trouble as often as it wins him friends -- Fenrir very much included."
